                                    <td class="c-cell-value" colspan="8" style="width:90%;">
                                        <div class="c-cell-content">
                                            <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>本项目旨在为</font><font>“华工助手</font></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>平台研发一款面向华南理工大学师生的校园智能体（</font><font>AI Agent</font></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">，探索</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">对话即服务</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">的新型人机交互模式。项目以</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">华工助手</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>现有功能模块（常用网页导航、贴吧生态、二手书交易、课表查询、评课系统、新生指南）为基础，构建一个能够理解自然语言指令、跨系统调度服务、主动提供个性化资讯的智能中枢。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">与传统</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">APP“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">用户点击按钮</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">—</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">系统响应</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">的模式不同，本项目将打造一个</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">以对话框为核心入口的智能交互平台</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">：用户通过语音或文字提出需求，智能体自主规划任务流程、调用后端工具、整合多源信息，最终直接呈现结果。例如，用户说</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">买高等数学二手书</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">，智能体无需用户手动翻帖，即可自动检索二手书交易板块，筛选匹配的商品并返回结果；用户说</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">推荐一门通识课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">，智能体将结合课表空闲时间与评课系统的高分课程，自动生成选课建议；智能体还能主动监测宿舍水电余量、考试安排等信息，通过消息推送实现</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">被动响应</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">向</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">主动服务</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>的跃升。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">项目将采用</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>大语言模型</font>+工具调用（MCP） </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">的技术架构，整合校园知识库与业务系统接口，打造真正</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">懂华工、懂学生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">的智能助手，为智慧校园建设提供可复用的技术范式。</span></p>
                                        </div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width:10%;" class="c-cell-title" colspan="2">负责人曾经参与科研的情况</td>
                                    <td class="c-cell-value" colspan="8" style="width:90%;">
                                        <div class="c-cell-content">
                                            
                                        </div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="width:10%;" class="c-cell-title" colspan="2">指导教师承担科研课题情况</td>
                                    <td class="c-cell-value" colspan="8" style="width:90%;">
                                        <div class="c-cell-content">
                                            <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>本项目旨在为</font><font>“华工助手</font></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>平台研发一款面向华南理工大学师生的校园智能体（</font><font>AI Agent</font></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">，探索</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">对话即服务</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">的新型人机交互模式。项目以</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">华工助手</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>现有功能模块（常用网页导航、贴吧生态、二手书交易、课表查询、评课系统、新生指南）为基础，构建一个能够理解自然语言指令、跨系统调度服务、主动提供个性化资讯的智能中枢。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">与传统</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">APP“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">用户点击按钮</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">—</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">系统响应</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">的模式不同，本项目将打造一个</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">以对话框为核心入口的智能交互平台</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">：用户通过语音或文字提出需求，智能体自主规划任务流程、调用后端工具、整合多源信息，最终直接呈现结果。例如，用户说</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">买高等数学二手书</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">，智能体无需用户手动翻帖，即可自动检索二手书交易板块，筛选匹配的商品并返回结果；用户说</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">推荐一门通识课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">，智能体将结合课表空闲时间与评课系统的高分课程，自动生成选课建议；智能体还能主动监测宿舍水电余量、考试安排等信息，通过消息推送实现</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">被动响应</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">向</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">主动服务</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>的跃升。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 10.5pt"></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">项目将采用</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>大语言模型</font>+工具调用（MCP） </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">的技术架构，整合校园知识库与业务系统接口，打造真正</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">懂华工、懂学生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 10.5pt">的智能助手，为智慧校园建设提供可复用的技术范式。</span></p>
