                <!--  一、	基本情况 结束-->
                <!--  二、	立项依据（可加页） 开始-->
                <div class="c-base-info">
                    <h4 class="c-base-info-title">
                        二、	立项依据（可加页）
                    </h4>
                    <div class="c-base-info-content">
                        <table class="c-lxyj-table">
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                （1）研究目的
                                                            </h4>
                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">1. 变革校园服务交互模式：突破传统APP“功能入口深、操作路径长”的局限，探索以自然语言为核心的“意图直达服务”新范式，让用户用一句话解决复杂事务。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2. 整合碎片化校园信息资源：将“华工助手”现有模块（二手书、课表、评课、贴吧等）以及学校各类业务系统（教务、后勤、一卡通）的数据与服务能力进行智能化封装，形成统一的服务出口。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">3. 验证智能体在高校场景的技术可行性：研究大语言模型在垂直领域的幻觉抑制方法、多工具协同调度机制、个性化主动服务策略，为校园场景的AI落地提供技术方案。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">4. 提升新生适应效率与在校生生活体验：通过萌新指南的智能问答、事务办理的自动化指引、生活提醒的主动推送，切实解决学生在校期间的高频痛点。</span>。</p><p><br></p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                （2）研究内容
                                                            </h4>
                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>本项目将围绕</font><font>“华工助手</font></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">智能体的研发，开展以下四个方面的研究：</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">1. 校园智能体架构设计与多源知识融合 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">构建</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">大语言模型</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">+</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">校园知识库</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">+</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">业务工具集</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">的三层架构。收集并结构化处理校园信息（规章制度、办事流程、新生指南、课程评价、二手交易数据等），构建动态更新的校园知识图谱。研究多源异构数据的向量化存储与检索增强生成（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">RAG</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>）方法，确保智能体回答的准确性与时效性。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2. 基于自然语言理解的意图识别与任务规划 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">针对校园高频场景（选课咨询、二手交易、事务办理、生活问答），设计意图分类器与槽位填充模型。研究复杂指令的语义解析与任务拆解能力，例如</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">推荐一门周二下午、给分高、不点名的通识课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>这类多条件约束的查询，智能体需能自主拆解条件、调用课表接口与评课数据库，最终生成符合要求的推荐列表。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">3. 多智能体协同与工具调用机制 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">借鉴</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">MCP</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">Model Context Protocol</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">）协议思想，设计标准化的工具调用接口。将</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">华工助手</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">各功能模块（二手书检索、课表查询、评课系统、贴吧搜索）封装为可被智能体调用的独立工具。针对复杂任务，探索多智能体协同模式</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">——</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">例如规划</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">Agent</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">负责任务拆解、执行</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">Agent</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">负责工具调用、校验</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">Agent</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>负责结果验证，实现复杂任务的自动化处理。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">4. 主动服务与个性化推送机制 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">研究基于用户画像与上下文感知的主动服务触发策略。系统可监测宿舍水电余量（对接后勤系统）、考试周安排（对接教务系统）、二手书求购热点（对接贴吧数据），在适当时机通过消息推送提醒用户。例如：</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">您宿舍水费余额不足</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">20</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">元，是否现在缴费？</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">”“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">高数考试临近，有</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">位同学正在出售《高等数学》二手书，需要查看吗？</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">”</span></p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                （3）创新点与项目特色
                                                            </h4>
                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">1. 从</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“图形界面”到“对话界面”的范式创新</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>本项目将彻底改变</font><font>“用户找功能</font></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">的传统</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">APP</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">模式，打造</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">一句话办事</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>的智能交互体验。用户无需在各级菜单中翻找，只需在对话框说出需求，智能体即可完成从意图理解到服务调用的全流程。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2. 面向高校场景的垂直领域智能体 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">区别于通用对话助手（如</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">ChatGPT</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">），本项目深度融合华南理工大学校园数据与业务场景，构建真正</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">懂华工</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">的垂直领域智能体。无论是选课规则、二手书交易惯例，还是萌新常问的</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">哪个食堂好吃</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>，智能体均能给出贴合本校实际的回答。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">3. “感知-决策-执行”闭环的主动服务能力 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">智能体不仅是</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">应答者</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">，更是</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">主动服务者</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">。通过对接校园业务系统，智能体可感知学生状态（如课表、余额、位置），预判需求并主动推送提醒，实现从</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">人找服务</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">到</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">服务找人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>的转变。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">4. 多端一致体验的智能中枢 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">项目成果将一次开发、多端部署，覆盖</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">APP</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">、网页、微信小程序三大入口。用户在任意端登录</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">华工助手</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">，均可享受一致的智能体服务，对话历史与个性化设置云端同步。</span></p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                （4）拟解决的问题及预期成果
                                                            </h4>
                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>拟解决的问题：</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">1. </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">信息过载与入口深</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">：解决学生面对众多功能入口</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">找不到、不会用</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>的问题，用对话直接触达服务。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2. 跨系统数据孤岛</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">：打通</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">华工助手</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>内部模块与外部校园系统，实现数据互通与服务协同。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">3. 新生适应门槛高</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>：将分散的萌新指南文章转化为可交互的智能问答，新生想问什么直接问，无需翻遍公众号。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">4. 重复咨询人力消耗</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>：将奖学金申请、校园卡挂失、报修流程等高频咨询交由智能体自动应答，减轻人工辅导员负担。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">预期成果：</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>完成项目结题报告；</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">学术论文</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">篇；软件著作权</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">项；</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">结题报告；</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">1. 一套可运行的“华工助手”智能体系统</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>：完成多端部署，支持二手书智能检索、通识课智能推荐、校园事务问答、主动生活提醒四大核心功能。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2. 一篇高质量学术论文</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>：总结校园智能体的架构设计与关键技术，投稿至教育信息化或人工智能相关期刊。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">3. 一份校园智能体开发指南</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">：梳理基于</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">MCP</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">的工具封装方法、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">RAG</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">知识库构建流程，为后续校园</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">AI</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>应用开发提供参考。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">4. 一项软件著作权或发明专利</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">：围绕</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">基于多智能体协同的校园主动服务方法</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">申请知识产权保护。</span></p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                （5）项目研究进度安排
                                                            </h4>
                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                <p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>第一</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>阶段</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2026年3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">-4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>月</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">需求调研与技术选型：收集学生高频需求，梳理可调用的</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">数据接口；确定大模型选型（如</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">DeepSeek</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">）、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">RAG</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">框架、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">MCP</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">工具协议方案。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>第二</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>阶段</font> </span></b><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2026年5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">-7</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>月</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">知识库构建与基础功能开发：收集校园规章制度、萌新指</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">南、课程评价等数据，完成向量化存储；实现二手书智能检索、校园问答原型。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>第三</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>阶段</font> </span></b><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10.5pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2026年8</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">-10</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>月</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">核心功能开发：实现课表与评课系统的数据打通；开发通</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">识课智能推荐功能；完成主动服务推送机制设计。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>第四</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>阶段</font> </span></b><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10.5pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2026年11</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>月</font><font>-12月 </font></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>多端集成与内测：将智能体集成至</font>APP</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">、网页、小程序；招募</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">50</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">名志愿者进行封闭测试，收集反馈优化。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>第五</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family: MicrosoftYaHei-Bold; color: rgba(191, 191, 191, 1); font-size: 9.5pt"><font>阶段</font> </span></b><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10.5pt"></span></p><p><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10.5pt">2027</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt">年</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10.5pt">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt">月</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10.5pt">-3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>月</font> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10.5pt"><font>成果总结与结题：撰写论文、申请软著、整理开发指南；</font></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt">完成项目结题报告。</span></p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="c-lxyj">
                                                            <h4 class="c-lxyj-title">
                                                                （6）对学生的要求
                                                            </h4>
                                                            <div class="c-lxyj-content">
                                                                <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">1. 专业背景：计算机、软件工程、人工智能等相关专业，对自然语言处理、大语言模型应用有浓厚兴趣。 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">2. 技术基础</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">：熟悉</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">Python</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">编程，了解基本的机器学习概念；有</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">Web</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>开发或小程序开发经验者优先。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">3. 学习能力</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">：能够快速学习大模型</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">Prompt</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">工程、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">RAG</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">技术、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">LangChain</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>等新兴框架，愿意动手尝试新技术。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">4. 产品思维</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">：关注用户体验，能从学生视角思考</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">怎样用</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">AI</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">真正解决问题</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"><font>，而非单纯技术实现。</font> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 125%; font-size: 12pt"></span></p><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">5. 团队协作</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 12pt">：具备良好的沟通能力，能够与团队成员分工协作，按时完成开发任务。</span></p>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>

                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </div>
